@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET /
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sách bài tập
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST hợp lệ (Tạo lượt nộp mới)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/signalr-demo"
}

### 4. GET đọc lại lượt nộp (Bấm Send liên tục để thấy received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu (Kiểm tra BadRequest 400)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bài 99 không tồn tại (Kiểm tra NotFound 404 hoặc lỗi route)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/test"
}

### 7. GET ID không hợp lệ hoặc rỗng
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR Hub (Negotiate đúng đường dẫn /hubs/submissions) -> 200
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub (Thiếu chữ s ở /hub/submissions) -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1